    "cold_start": "uv run --locked python -X importtime -c 'import <module>', 3 runs each; total = sum of all importtime self-times per run (ms); median across runs. Run 1 of each triple was FS-cache-cold and visibly slower - the median absorbs it. top5 lists are from the median-total run."
